	"changelog": "* Prevents ambiguous title-only Open, Pin, and Archive actions in Chat History when two recent chats share a title.\n* Directs users to the native Recents list to choose the intended chat, while unique titles keep working as before.\n* Adds an app-scoped, optionally assignable action for a native, searchable list of up to 100 newest conversation turns, with full text in a read-only pane. No key is assigned by default because NVDA+Alt+Shift+R conflicts with an NVDA command.\n* Makes the conversation list's Refresh button request a new scan without blocking the button handler.\n* Focuses the selected message after the list dialog is displayed.\n* Adds a General settings checkbox to enable or disable the native message list without affecting ChatGPT's ordinary conversation view.",
